   <p style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><i><b>India Biodiesel Revenues:&#160;</b></i>We sell biodiesel to the government-owned India Oil Market Companies pursuant to tender offers, and we sell refined glycerin to private parties. We also occasionally sell feedstock based on market conditions. The following table shows sales in our India Biodiesel segment by product category:</p>
