   <ix:exclude>&#160;</ix:exclude>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The components of lease expense are as follows:</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
