   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">The options outstanding as of&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>&#160;include vested rights to purchase&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c148834818" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_PlanNameAxis-The2019StockPlanMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedNumberOfShares" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">6.9</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million shares and the remaining purchase rights are <em style="font: inherit;">not</em> yet vested<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">.</span> </p>
   <p style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <ix:exclude>
    <div class="PGFTR" style="width:100%;">
     <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-align:center;"><em style="font: inherit;">20</em></p>
    </div>
