   <div style="font-size:10pt;">
    <div style="font-family:Times New Roman;">
     <div style="font-variant:normal;">
       &#160;
     </div>
     <div style="font-variant:normal;">
      <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">During the&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">six</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em>, we recognized&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c148834829" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">2.8</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c148834830" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">3.7</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million of stock-based compensation expense. During these periods, we granted&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c148834831" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-RestrictedStockMember_PlanNameAxis-The2019StockPlanMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">379</ix:nonFraction>&#160;thousand&#160;and&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c148834832" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-RestrictedStockMember_PlanNameAxis-The2019StockPlanMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">396</ix:nonFraction>&#160;thousand shares of common stock under the <em style="font: inherit;">2019</em> Stock Plan, respectively, with an average market value on date of grant of&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c148834834" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-RestrictedStockMember_PlanNameAxis-The2019StockPlanMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">2.44</ix:nonFraction>&#160;and&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c148834835" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-RestrictedStockMember_PlanNameAxis-The2019StockPlanMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">2.73</ix:nonFraction>,&#160;respectively, per share.&#160;</p>
     </div>
    </div>
   </div>
   <div style="font-size:10pt;">
    <div style="font-family:'Times New Roman';">
     <div style="font-variant:normal;">
       &#160;
     </div>
     <div style="font-variant:normal;">
      <p style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;text-indent:0pt;">As of&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>, we<span style="background-color:#ffffff;"> ha</span>d&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c148834836" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_PlanNameAxis-The2019StockPlanMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedStockOptions" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">6.1</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million of total unrecognized compensation expense for option issuances, which we will amortize over the remaining vesting period for each applicable grant, which has a weighted average of&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_PlanNameAxis-The2019StockPlanMember" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedPeriodForRecognition1" id="c148834837" format="ixt-sec:duryear">2.17</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;years as of&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>.</p>
     </div>
    </div>
   </div>
   <p style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
  </ix:nonNumeric>
  <div></div>
  <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" name="amtx:OutstandingWarrantsTextBlock" id="c3246289" escape="true">
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;text-indent:0pt;"><b><em style="font: inherit;">10.</em> Warrants to Purchase Common Stock</b> </p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;text-indent:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;text-indent:0pt;">On <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026, </em>the maturity dates on <em style="font: inherit;">two</em> accredited investors' Subordinated Notes were extended to <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2026. </em>In connection with the extension, we granted the noteholders warrants exercisable for the purchase of <ix:nonFraction id="c148834881" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis-WarrantsInConnectionWithSubordinatedNotesMember_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis-AAFKMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">113</ix:nonFraction> thousand shares of Aemetis, Inc. common stock with a term of <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c148834882">two</span> years and an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction id="c148834883" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis-WarrantsInConnectionWithSubordinatedNotesMember_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis-AAFKMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">0.01</ix:nonFraction> per share.&#160;The warrants were fully exercised by the noteholders in <em style="font: inherit;"> July 2026.</em></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;text-indent:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;text-indent:0pt;">The following table summarizes warrant activity during the&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">six</em>&#160;months ending&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>:</p>
