   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="background-color:#fff;"><i>California Ethanol:</i> Sales of ethanol, WDG, and corn oil to <ix:nonFraction id="c148835012" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueSegmentMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_ProductOrServiceAxis-EthanolSalesWetDistillersGrainAndCornOilSalesMember_StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis-CaliforniaEthanolMember" unitRef="Pure" name="amtx:NumberOfMajorCustomers" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF">one</ix:nonFraction> customer (J.D. Heiskell) accounted&#160;for&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c148835013" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueSegmentMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-CustomerOneMember_ProductOrServiceAxis-EthanolSalesWetDistillersGrainAndCornOilSalesMember_StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis-CaliforniaEthanolMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">87.4</ix:nonFraction>%&#160;and&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c148835014" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueSegmentMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-CustomerOneMember_ProductOrServiceAxis-EthanolSalesWetDistillersGrainAndCornOilSalesMember_StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis-CaliforniaEthanolMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">99.4</ix:nonFraction>%&#160;of our California Ethanol segment revenues for the <em style="font: inherit;">three</em> months ended&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em>, respectively. J.D. Heiskell accounted&#160;for&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c148835017" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueSegmentMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-CustomerOneMember_ProductOrServiceAxis-EthanolSalesWetDistillersGrainAndCornOilSalesMember_StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis-CaliforniaEthanolMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">89.7</ix:nonFraction>%&#160;and&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c148835018" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueSegmentMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-CustomerOneMember_ProductOrServiceAxis-EthanolSalesWetDistillersGrainAndCornOilSalesMember_StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis-CaliforniaEthanolMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">99.4</ix:nonFraction>%&#160;of our California Ethanol Segment sales for the&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">six</em>&#160;months ended&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em>, respectively.</span> </p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;"><i>California Dairy Renewable Natural Gas:</i>&#160;Sales of RNG during the&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">three</em> and&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">six</em>&#160;months ended&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em>, were to a <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c148835049"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c148835050">single</span></span> customer. We sold <em style="font: inherit;">D3</em> RINs and LCFS credits to <em style="font: inherit;">two</em> other customers.</span> </p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;text-indent:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;"><i>India Biodiesel:</i>&#160;For the <em style="font: inherit;">three</em> months ended&#160;</span><em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em><span style="font-size:10pt;">, <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c148835027">three</span> customers accounted for&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c148835028" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueSegmentMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-CustomerOneMember_StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis-IndiaBiodieselSegmentMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">23</ix:nonFraction>%,&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c148835029" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueSegmentMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-CustomerTwoMember_StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis-IndiaBiodieselSegmentMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">25</ix:nonFraction>%, and&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c148835030" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueSegmentMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-CustomerThreeMember_StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis-IndiaBiodieselSegmentMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">36</ix:nonFraction>%&#160;of our India Biodiesel segment's revenues. For the&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">six</em>&#160;months ended&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>, <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c148835032">three</span> customers accounted for&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c148835033" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-