  <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionsDisclosureTextBlock" id="c3246300" escape="true">
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b><em style="font: inherit;">14.</em> Related Party Transactions</b> </p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">As of&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>, the&#160;Company had amounts payable totaling&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c148835355" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis-EmploymentAgreementsAndExpenseReimbursementsMember_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis-MrMcafeeMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionAmountsOfTransaction" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">1.7</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million to&#160;Eric McAfee, our Chairman and Chief Executive Officer,&#160;and McAfee Capital LLC, an entity&#160;owned by Mr.&#160;McAfee.&#160;These amounts consist of&#160;accrued compensation and related amounts under&#160;employment agreements and&#160;bonus awards,&#160;expense reimbursements, and guarantee fees associated with guarantees&#160;provided by Mr. McAfee and&#160;McAfee Capital in connection with the Company's&#160;indebtedness to Third Eye Capital.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">In addition, as of <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026, </em>the Company had amounts payable totaling $<ix:nonFraction id="c148835356" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis-OtherMembersOfManagementMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AccruedBonusesCurrentAndNoncurrent" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">0.9</ix:nonFraction> million to other members of management related to awarded but unpaid bonus compensation.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">&#160;</p>
